Measures the uplink on a schedule and keeps the results on the firewall itself.
Three providers: Cloudflare (default, standard library only, reports the PoP it
measured against), Ookla via speedtest-cli (optionally pinned to one server ID),
and iperf3 against a public server. Adds a Reporting - Speedtest page (latest
result, min/avg/max, chart, history table with a provider filter, run on demand
with any provider) and a dashboard widget showing the latest result of the
default provider with a sparkline of its last 20 tests. The "Run uplink speedtest" job can be scheduled under System - Settings - Cron and uses the
default provider. History is a JSON file capped at the last 1000 results.
